    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195530/extras/7ea2e07f52929b86b464a8760e816514.avif?t=1740927479\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tania is a young streamer with low self-esteem who, manipulated by her friend Eidzoku, dives into the world of explicit photo shoots and online exploitation. In search of validation and confidence, she receives a flood of attention, but her life gradually spirals out of balance. Her dependence on online approval deepens, and her real-life relationships fall apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195530/extras/ed077d14b0a0b82e0b4fd0b9535531bc.avif?t=1740927479\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Tania becomes entangled in manipulative, toxic relationships and subjected to humiliation by a group known as &quot;The Aristocrats,&quot; she is victimized by violence. However, her inner traumas and deviant tendencies only intensify. As she sinks further into this dark world, Tania loses control of her life, becoming a victim of her own insecurities and destructive desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195530/extras/8ee4126d34ef807461333716603f4786.avif?t=1740927479\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195530/extras/64702b3e613484cebfe2df9580b5a2eb.avif?t=1740927479\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story-driven visual novel delves deep into the emotional and psychological journey of the protagonist, Tania. The game focuses on exploring her inner struggles, insecurities, and the impact of toxic relationships through a captivating narrative. Players will experience detailed and explicit sexual scenes that are integral to revealing Tania\u2019s state of mind, reflecting her complex emotions and evolving psychological state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195530/extras/9800a2c167a726ec594a9f5adfd683f7.avif?t=1740927479\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The linear storyline emphasizes the character\u2019s development, offering a raw and immersive exploration of her life. The game also features a wealth of high-quality artwork, ensuring that every scene, whether intimate or emotional, is depicted with careful attention to detail and artistry. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195530/extras/55423b6ac1017367d00a203d9522f174.avif?t=1740927479\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Exciting story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Thrilling art<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195530/extras/81a64155a775a98d3d0c9ca371fb6234.avif?t=1740927479\" width=800 height=1317 /></span></p>",
